{
  "total_duration": 660.705,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.6,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "逃学当然不是好事，可这篇文章偏偏叫"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The record-holder"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 6.95,
      "end": 10.83,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "为什么一个逃学的孩子会被说成“纪录保持者”？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 11.18,
      "end": 18.855,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为他不是躲在电影院里，而是一路从"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "England"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "跑到了"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "France"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 19.205,
      "end": 24.245,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但作者不是在表扬他，而是在用夸张和讽刺讲一个荒唐故事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 24.595,
      "end": 32.023,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天我们一边看路线，一边学会分辨"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "humour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "behaviour advice"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 32.373,
      "end": 34.613,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先看讽刺开头。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 34.963,
      "end": 44.083,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：作者说逃学的孩子缺乏想象力，通常最多钓鱼一天，或者在电影院里反复看同一部电影。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 44.433,
      "end": 49.308,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Children who play truant from school are unimaginative"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 49.658,
      "end": 56.818,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Play truant from school"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是逃学、翘课，不是请假，也不是学校活动。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 57.168,
      "end": 66.608,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文又说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A quiet day's fishing, or eight hours in a cinema seeing the same film over and over again, is usually as far as they get"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 66.958,
      "end": 76.006,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "然后作者反过来夸张："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "They have all been put to shame by a boy who, while playing truant, travelled 1,600 miles"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 76.356,
      "end": 82.036,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的“纪录”不是光荣称号，而是把一个错误行为写得荒唐又好记。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 82.386,
      "end": 86.346,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，看第一次意外跨海。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 86.695,
      "end": 94.639,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：男孩搭便车到"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Dover"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，傍晚钻进一条船，想找地方睡觉。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 94.989,
      "end": 101.641,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He hitchhiked to Dover and, towards evening, went into a boat to find somewhere to sleep"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 101.991,
      "end": 107.919,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Hitchhiked"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是搭陌生人的车；这个词要学，但行为不能模仿。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 108.269,
      "end": 113.733,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二天早上，他发现船已经到了"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Calais"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 114.083,
      "end": 121.478,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "When he woke up next morning, he discovered that the boat had, in the meantime, travelled to Calais"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 121.828,
      "end": 128.812,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In the meantime"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "表示在这段时间里，男孩睡着时，船已经跨过英吉利海峡。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 129.162,
      "end": 131.562,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，看路线越走越偏。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 131.912,
      "end": 140.48,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：男孩悄悄下船，从"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Calais"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "又搭卡车去"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Paris"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 140.83,
      "end": 144.938,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "No one noticed the boy as he crept off"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 145.287,
      "end": 150.823,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Crept off"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是悄悄溜走，说明他还在逃避责任。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 151.173,
      "end": 155.829,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "接着是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "From there, he hitchhiked to Paris in a lorry"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 156.179,
      "end": 160.459,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "司机给了他几块饼干和一杯咖啡，把他留在城外。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 160.809,
      "end": 169.305,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "lorry"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是英式英语里的卡车，美式英语常说"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "truck"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 169.654,
      "end": 172.894,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，看最大的反转和后果。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 173.244,
      "end": 182.916,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：下一辆车没有把男孩带进巴黎市中心，却把他带到法国南部靠近西班牙边境的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Perpignan"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 183.266,
      "end": 192.558,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The next car the boy stopped did not take him into the centre of Paris as he hoped it would, but to Perpignan on the French-Spanish border"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 192.908,
      "end": 201.164,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "As he hoped it would"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是“像他希望的那样”，后面马上被"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "but"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "推翻。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 201.514,
      "end": 207.91,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "There he was picked up by a policeman and sent back to England by the local authorities"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 208.259,
      "end": 215.059,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "当地当局不是反派，他们是在把一个独自跨国的孩子带回安全和学校责任。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 215.409,
      "end": 221.969,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "结尾说他为想逃学的孩子创造了纪录，这仍然是讽刺，不是表扬。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 222.319,
      "end": 226.149,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，这个男孩跑了这么远，是不是很勇敢？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 226.499,
      "end": 232.659,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不。故事写得好笑，不代表行为正确。He was unsafe and irresponsible."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 233.009,
      "end": 236.428,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那为什么叫"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "record-holder"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 236.778,
      "end": 245.098,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为作者在 mock praise，假装赞叹他“把逃学玩出了纪录”。其实是在讽刺一个坏主意被推到荒唐程度。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 245.448,
      "end": 248.793,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Put to shame"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是什么意思？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 249.143,
      "end": 257.383,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "字面像“让别人羞愧”，这里是说普通逃学孩子都被他比下去了。语气很夸张，也很讽刺。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 257.733,
      "end": 259.861,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "路线我有点乱。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 260.211,
      "end": 280.334,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "记一条线就够了："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "England"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "到"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Dover"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，船到"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Calais"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，卡车去"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Paris"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "附近，再一路到南法靠近西班牙边界的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Perpignan"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，最后回"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "England"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 280.684,
      "end": 285.071,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Hitchhike"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是不是就是免费搭车？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 285.421,
      "end": 298.421,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对，向路过车辆求搭载。它常出现在旧故事里，但现代儿童安全规则很清楚：不要搭陌生人的车，不要藏进车辆或船里，不要独自跨边境。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 298.771,
      "end": 301.506,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那警察为什么把他送回去？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 301.856,
      "end": 313.192,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为孩子独自在陌生地方很危险。"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Local authorities"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "指当地负责公共秩序和安全的人或机构，他们做的是保护和处理后果。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 313.542,
      "end": 316.97,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以这篇可以觉得好笑，但不能照着做？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 317.32,
      "end": 324.92,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Exactly. A story can be funny without being advice. 真正要学的是路线、讽刺语气和安全边界。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 325.27,
      "end": 329.134,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Children who play truant from school are unimaginative."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 329.484,
      "end": 336.54,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A quiet day's fishing, or eight hours in a cinema seeing the same film over and over again, is usually as far as they get."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 336.89,
      "end": 343.13,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "They have all been put to shame by a boy who, while playing truant, travelled 1,600 miles."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 343.48,
      "end": 348.904,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He hitchhiked to Dover and, towards evening, went into a boat to find somewhere to sleep."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 349.254,
      "end": 355.206,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "When he woke up next morning, he discovered that the boat had, in the meantime, travelled to Calais."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 355.556,
      "end": 358.7,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "No one noticed the boy as he crept off."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 359.049,
      "end": 362.577,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "From there, he hitchhiked to Paris in a lorry."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "start": 362.927,
      "end": 368.279,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The driver gave him a few biscuits and a cup of coffee and left him just outside the city."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 55,
      "start": 368.629,
      "end": 376.333,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The next car the boy stopped did not take him into the centre of Paris as he hoped it would, but to Perpignan on the French-Spanish border."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 56,
      "start": 376.683,
      "end": 381.963,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "There he was picked up by a policeman and sent back to England by the local authorities."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 57,
      "start": 382.313,
      "end": 387.545,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He has surely set up a record for the thousands of children who dream of evading school."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
